<title>FRANCE: BoF to give news conference on June 24.</title>
<headline>BoF to give news conference on June 24.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bank of France governor Jean-Claude Trichet will hold a news conference at 0800 GMT on Tuesday, June 24, the Bank said in a statement.</p>
<p>The news conference is to present the central bank's annual report, the Bank said.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +331 4221 5452</p>
